  "consentIntro": "Kabla ya kuanza, tafadhali soma jinsi ATMS inavyotumia taarifa zako binafsi. Taarifa hii inazingatia Sheria ya Ulinzi wa Taarifa Binafsi ya Tanzania, 2022.",
  "@consentIntro": {
    "description": "SW_REVIEW: Consent intro. Legal text: client must review."
  },
  "consentRetentionBody": "Kumbukumbu za kazi na za ukaguzi zinahifadhiwa kwa angalau miaka 3, au kama taasisi yako itakavyoamua, kwa ajili ya uwajibikaji.",
  "@consentRetentionBody": {
    "description": "SW_REVIEW: Consent: retention."
  },
  "consentRetentionTitle": "Tunazihifadhi kwa muda gani",
